    "Generic open-wheel single-seater with 2026-style proportions; no real team, livery or sponsor.",
    "Front wing: main plane chord 0.30 m, span 1.79 m; flap 1 chord 0.20 m and flap 2 chord 0.15 m, each 2 x 0.765 m (|y| 0.13..0.895). Node front_flap carries both flaps and rotates about the hinge line through (2.555, 0.0, 0.135) along -y: + = flatter / low drag, range (-5.0, 25.0) deg.",
