    "Floor from x = 1.16 (raised leading edge, z 0.15) to the diffuser exit at x = -2.02; flat underside z = 0.035 between x = 0.55 and -1.22, plank bottom z = 0.025 (x 0.55..-1.15, 0.30 m wide), diffuser roof rises to z = 0.27 at the exit, half width 0.50. Full aero geometry under rig 'aero'.",
    "Suspension travel: front -0.040..+0.030 m, rear -0.045..+0.035 m; at about +0.025 m bump the plank reaches the ground (the chassis bottoms out, as intended for a ground-effect car).",
    "Steering wheel +-180 deg vs road-wheel steer +-22 deg (overall ratio ~8.2:1). Kingpin: vertical (no inclination / caster) through the upright ball joints, 0.1 m inboard of the wheel centre plane (steer_XX pivot), so the front wheels swing about it when steered.",
